1
00:00:00,189 --> 00:00:02,389
(Raj:)He said he couldn't afford
to send me money anymore

2
00:00:02,391 --> 00:00:04,721
(Raj:)because of
his active social life.

3
00:00:04,727 --> 00:00:09,127
(Mrs Koothrapalli:)What does that mean,
"active social life"?

4
00:00:09,131 --> 00:00:10,701
(Raj:)Well, let's not talk about him

5
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:12,970
(Raj:)or whatever shenanigans
he may or may not be up to.

6
00:00:12,969 --> 00:00:14,199
(Raj:)Let's talk about you.

7
00:00:14,203 --> 00:00:17,303
(Mrs Koothrapalli:)Rajesh, is your father
seeing someone?

8
00:00:17,306 --> 00:00:18,976
(Raj:)All I know, Mummy, is that

9
00:00:18,975 --> 00:00:22,145
(Raj:)he's a single wealthy doctor,
and now, for some reason,

10
00:00:22,144 --> 00:00:25,314
(Raj:)there's no money
for your little boy.

11
00:00:27,048 --> 00:00:29,618
(Mrs Koothrapalli:)Well, however much money
your father was giving you,

12
00:00:29,619 --> 00:00:30,819
(Mrs Koothrapalli:)I'll give you more.

13
00:00:30,820 --> 00:00:32,820
Thank you, Mummy, I love you!

14
00:00:32,822 --> 00:00:34,792
(quietly):
Helicopters for everybody!

15
00:00:37,158 --> 00:00:39,658
(Penny:)What's taking so long?

16
00:00:39,662 --> 00:00:41,232
LEONARD: I don't think
this is gonna work.

17
00:00:41,230 --> 00:00:42,300
(Penny:)Just let me see.

18
00:00:48,003 --> 00:00:50,643
(Penny:)Sweetie, you know
you're supposed to wear clothes

19
00:00:50,640 --> 00:00:52,240
(Penny:)underneath a graduation gown.

20
00:00:52,241 --> 00:00:54,341
A: surprised you know that.

21
00:00:55,443 --> 00:00:58,613
B: I wanted to look like
a sexy graduate for you.

